transform into a bird. \n\nThemes: magpie, sewing, night sky with stars\n\nReference images: https://drive.google.com/drive/u/2/folders/1ljHNPxOBscaPQEKz43wLH-dkt3Y2OwZ6\n\nI will leave the pose and composition up to you. Please draw freely. If it seems too difficult, please feel free to appeal the price or decline!\n\nThank you for considering..! 💞", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kalinearc/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2540362, "client_id": 10808, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1d6d2374/uploads/origins/10f25757-7750-4a6a-b005-8c9c5ca272be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1e3f4e6135de11c74390fe638ab9fc99", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1d6d2374/uploads/origins/10f25757-7750-4a6a-b005-8c9c5ca272be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1e3f4e6135de11c74390fe638ab9fc99, https://si.imgix.net/1d6d2374/uploads/origins/10f25757-7750-4a6a-b005-8c9c5ca272be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f4c5f985c07afd46ffb0a7f12d6d070 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1d6d2374/uploads/origins/10f25757-7750-4a6a-b005-8c9c5ca272be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df0992fe2d7506c8f12e449a277313ab 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1d6d2374/uploads/origins/10f25757-7750-4a6a-b005-8c9c5ca272be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=010c8d3fa4cd5695f4a51deb5f3f2364", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1d6d2374/uploads/origins/10f25757-7750-4a6a-b005-8c9c5ca272be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=010c8d3fa4cd5695f4a51deb5f3f2364, https://si.imgix.net/1d6d2374/uploads/origins/10f25757-7750-4a6a-b005-8c9c5ca272be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b0094f2a826c848a2d9f7dfb761f91cf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1d6d2374/uploads/origins/10f25757-7750-4a6a-b005-8c9c5ca272be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b17dedac37f67f1f098906e54802cf70 3x"}, "body": "Hello, I really enjoy how you play with colors and textures in your art and fell in love! Would it be okay to request my OC? I have included information about them below. \n\n⇒ Maron 栗 (17)\n- They are agender | X ジェンダー (無性)\n- Maron has a timid personality but isn’t afraid of speaking against other people when it truly matters.\n- Naturally rational and smart but can be tense due to working too hard for others’ sake.\n- Wears oversized clothes so they can give them to their younger siblings.\n- Their themes include nature, chestnuts, autumn and puzzles! 🌿🌰🍂🧩\n\nFeel free to choose the composition, colors, background, etc. however you'd like! *^^*  Outfit change is OK too as long as they match Maron’s theme.\n\nThank you so much for your consideration! ♡\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-4eWNAHeHPzpyDEbiftIofrPV06d-UHZ", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kalinearc/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2540362, "client_id": 187973, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2559e0bc/uploads/origins/222a6729-71ec-4739-b024-8e7308ed1112?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd0b2ff175f6e25712e105976cc42971", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2559e0bc/uploads/origins/222a6729-71ec-4739-b024-8e7308ed1112?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd0b2ff175f6e25712e105976cc42971, https://si.imgix.net/2559e0bc/uploads/origins/222a6729-71ec-4739-b024-8e7308ed1112?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=79bae4c5e132832f6d286eea77776df3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2559e0bc/uploads/origins/222a6729-71ec-4739-b024-8e7308ed1112?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7b3a31b99f4160108510df80d0b1c80 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2559e0bc/uploads/origins/222a6729-71ec-4739-b024-8e7308ed1112?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8d688e92fbf28e68b0a6170ef6246dda", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2559e0bc/uploads/origins/222a6729-71ec-4739-b024-8e7308ed1112?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8d688e92fbf28e68b0a6170ef6246dda, https://si.imgix.net/2559e0bc/uploads/origins/222a6729-71ec-4739-b024-8e7308ed1112?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=17ceb13f1ce00e6a0cfc9ea470437638 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2559e0bc/uploads/origins/222a6729-71ec-4739-b024-8e7308ed1112?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=785b3090c6fd371e246c6e5581f539a0 3x"}, "body": "はじめまして！\n\n私のオリジナルキャラクター、エヴリンのイラストを描いていただけませんか？現代CoCのTRPG設定です。\n\n宇宙物理学者で、ちょっと真面目で嫌味な性格なのですが、いじわるなところもあります。\n舞台は現代。\n長身痩躯。胸はぺったんこ。\n宇宙や天体物理学に関すること、星を眺めること、洋服を買うこと、小さな動物のフィギュア（シルバニアファミリーなど）を集めることが好き。\nまた、やや悪役っぽい一面もある。\n\nポーズや構図はお任せします！\n\nいずれにせよ、リクエストを読んでくださって本当にありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1K454QEhmjZ1i2wv1eVHU4ZRGDBanNO4F?usp=share_link", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 213957, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "鈍挫", "screen_name": "gyosonnotamiyo", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1581370223281963014/5nSMrHOJ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/prof